  CHECKPOINT, VACUUM, ANALYZE, PREPARE, EXECUTE, DEALLOCATE, LOAD, INSTALL, COMMENT, TRUNCATE, SUMMARIZE, CREATE_SECRET, DROP_SECRET, MULTI,
